13. Can Spring Boot handle only one DataSource?

→ Yes, Spring Boot can configure a single DataSource automatically using application properties.
→ I configure the database URL, username, password, and driver.
→ Spring Boot can create the DataSource and configure JdbcTemplate or JPA repositories.
→ Multiple DataSources require additional configuration to identify the correct DataSource and transaction manager.

