17. Sort employees by salary; if equal, sort by ID.

Approach:

→ First, compare employees by salary.
→ If salaries are equal, compare their IDs.
→ Use thenComparing() to add the secondary sorting condition.

Code:

employees.stream()
    .sorted(
        Comparator.comparingDouble(Employee::getSalary)
            .thenComparing(Employee::getId)
    );

→ This sorts salary in ascending order and uses ID in ascending order for ties.
→ For descending salary, use Comparator.comparingDouble(Employee::getSalary).reversed() and then add the ID comparator separately.

